␀␀QŸ␀␀Å␀␀TÅ&␀␀Ç␀␀Ÿ␀␀Å'␀␀PQYY0Å(␀␀PQVŸ␀␀.Å␀␀SY`␀␀␀␀␀GDSC␀␀␀␀␀␀∑␀␀␀˝␀␀␀æ␀␀␀␀␀¯Ÿ“”∂∂∂∂␀␀␀Úˇ˜˙˘Ò„Û∂∂∂∂␀␀␀Èƒ”◊“œ∂∂␀␀␀␀␀␀Here to improve your aim?␀␀␀␀␀␀T␀␀␀I love spending time at the lounge, it's so relaxing. All my worries just melt away.␀␀␀E␀␀␀They just finished renovating the kill box. It's quite something now.␀␀␀␀␀␀7␀␀␀This place has a mysterious atmosphere don't you think?␀␀␀␀R␀␀␀I can occasionally hear somebody talking when nobody else is here. It's upsetting.␀␀␀␀␀r␀␀␀I've heard the rumors about what happened at your last job. Don't let it get to you buddy, we're all here for you.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀You seem cool.␀␀␀␀␀'␀␀␀Coming here is literally therapy to me.␀␀␀␀}␀␀␀I've heard rumors of a weapon older than God that taps into the unbound potential of the financial world. Has to be bullshit.␀␀␀␀␀␀ó␀␀␀I fucked up my last job pretty bad. I got the targets but accidentally got a bunch of civilians killed. Still got paid of course but I feel pretty bad.␀␀␀␀M␀␀␀What's your favorite weapon? I'm really into anything that shoots flechettes.␀␀␀␀␀␀6␀␀␀It's a good idea to take a break every now and then...␀␀␀␀␀*␀␀␀Some day I would like to meet Elsa Holmes.␀␀␀␀␀(␀␀␀I can't talk right now I'm running late.␀␀␀J␀␀␀Boss has been bullying me all the time recently, I hope someone kills him.␀␀␀␀␀.␀␀␀I'm so tired of cleaning up excrement. Why me?␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Yawn␀␀␀6␀␀␀Have you tried the new Coffee Burger? That shit slaps.␀␀␀␀␀-␀␀␀I wish I was at home playing Gorbino's Quest.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀What did they do to your face?␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Holy fuck you're ugly.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀What's that smell?␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀I'm so fucking tired.␀␀␀␀␀␀o␀␀␀We've made a breakthrough in combinining rat and human DNA. The result isn't exactly what we expected though...␀␀␀␀c␀␀␀The smells from the lab make me nauseous. There's something wrong with the ventilation system here.␀␀␀␀I␀␀␀Ever since I slipped and hit my head I've been craving Hungry Human Soda.␀␀␀␀␀␀\␀␀␀Weird mushrooms keep growing on my lawn. I really don't need this shit in my life right now.␀␀␀W␀␀␀My neighbor loves deconstructed classic rock. That's fine but he should get headphones.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Do you hear that screaming?␀␀␀␀␀␀␀What are you doing here?␀␀␀5␀␀␀Are you one of those open carry guys? I respect that.␀␀␀␀␀␀l␀␀␀They're trying to make it legal to cook meth. Don't get me wrong I'm into freedom but that's a step too far.␀␀␀4␀␀␀I really look up to people who are good at violence.␀␀␀V␀␀␀Who doesn't love a good peeperoni pizza after a hard day of trading? I mean pepperoni.␀␀␀␀␀G␀␀␀One day I'll be on that rocket to Mercury. Then my dad will respect me.␀␀␀␀k␀␀␀Working conditions here are quite rough but it's all for the greater good. Some sacrifices have to be made.␀␀␀␀(␀␀␀Oh you're one of the new security hires?␀␀␀h␀␀␀Did you know we also make tactical nuclear warheads? That's how we fund the space business. Pretty cool.␀␀␀M␀␀␀The space elevator construction is behind schedule. It's making me depressed.␀␀␀␀␀␀H␀␀␀I've heard weird noises from the server room... Hope it's not fleshrats.␀␀␀j␀␀␀What are you talking about? If I didn't believe in what I was doing I'd simply leave and find another job.␀␀␀␀␀R␀␀␀According to the latest research the living conditions on Mercury aren't that bad.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀...␀␀␀␀␀␀␀I just want to go home.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀I've lost count of days.␀␀␀g␀␀␀Keep having these recurring nightmares about transforming into a bouncy castle... It's freaking me out.␀␀␀␀Ñ␀␀␀I don't know where the food they give us here comes from. I swear it moves sometimes and the headache it gives me is something else.␀␀␀7␀␀␀The sounds here at night... I don't know, I just don't.␀␀␀␀G␀␀␀Someone's in my head. I can feel someone else's body as if it was mine.␀␀␀␀J␀␀␀So apparently the fleshrats just escaped from some biotech lab? Great job.␀␀␀␀␀P␀␀␀I'm here to buy Chunkopops for my son. He can't get enough of that plastic crap.␀␀␀q␀␀␀Dropped by GamesGames only to find out they're all out of Gorbino's Quest. Do you know about artificial scarcity?␀␀␀␀␀␀p␀␀␀Had a meat lover's at the Pizza House. I think the Meatoids they put on them have become worse quality recently.␀␀␀ç␀␀␀The Donut World at the main plaza is completely overrun by cops due to the rally. I really wanted to feast on some of those delicious treats.␀␀␀␀␀␀Ä␀␀␀I simply adore the Megamall atmosphere. The hustle and bustle, the beat of the city, the squirming chthonic energy. Magnificent.␀␀␀d␀␀␀Apparently there's a minor fleshrat infestation going on here... Thankfully haven't seen any myself.␀␀␀n␀␀␀If you put your ear against the wall you might hear the mall speak. That's what the urban legend says anyways.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Punishment huh... What's that?␀␀␀␀␀~␀␀␀You're here to protect the governor? Don't take this personally, I don't like him. He's making life hard for people of wealth.␀␀␀␀␀1␀␀␀They say I have to live here because I've sinned.␀␀␀␀␀␀^␀␀␀This place reeks of mold and shit. If I had a choice I'd pack my things and leave immediately.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀What's with the commotion?␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Hello neighbor!␀␀␀␀␀␀␀I can't sleep.␀␀␀␀␀ó␀␀␀Last night I got up to take a piss and guess what I saw? A real live fleshrat! I immediately reached for my home defence xiphos and sliced that fucker.␀␀␀␀I␀␀␀Third time the cops come here this week. Why can't they just let us live?␀␀␀␀␀␀l␀␀␀Saw a big guy with crazy eye implants and a huge gun... Didn't seem like a cop to me. Do you know what's up?␀␀␀␀␀␀I just love the salty sea air.␀␀␀␀␀Å␀␀␀When I heard about the opportunity to live here as a permanent resident I immediately took the chance. I don't regret it one bit.␀␀␀␀␀␀W␀␀␀I never had sex before I moved here but now I'm fucking a different bioslave every day.␀␀␀␀Ü␀␀␀We finally have it, we're fully sovereign. Just a couple of shareholders grabbing hold of their destinies on the open seas. Beautiful.␀␀␀␀␀]␀␀␀If you think about it, the joint-stock company truly is the perfect model for all governance.␀␀␀␀␀␀>␀␀␀Th